{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4ab294c1-232a-5c0e-83a5-8c1c3897c824", "source_ordinal": 1389, "reading_ordinal": 2668, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "自脱罗网", "published_at": "2024-08-14T17:34:01+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/57195a605a2011efa55052540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "人一定要对自己的权柄有概念，这样可以少很多折磨。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "很多问题你之所以觉得为难，其实不是因为你缺少智慧，而是因为你根本就缺少权柄——即为你的立场承担责任的能力和资源。", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 81}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你为什么在为这个问题痛苦纠结？因为你知道你说了同意也罢，不同意也罢，你就要为你的同意或者不同意负责。你发现付不起责，所以你在痛苦。", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 147}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你有没有想过——你之所以付不起责，是因为你本来就没有表态的必要权柄？", "char_start": 148, "char_end": 182}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这个问题的正确答案既不是“我同意“，也不是“我不同意”，而是“我无权表态”。", "char_start": 183, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "我无权表态、无权决定、无权干预的事情，我的同意或者不同意是没有意义的，连思考这种问题都是徒耗生命。", "char_start": 222, "char_end": 271}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这不是说我没有倾向和意愿，也不是说我不会努力去尽可能推动我的意愿实现，但这不叫“同意 / 不同意”。", "char_start": 272, "char_end": 322}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "我尽力而为，没实现我就接受现实，这不叫“我不同意”，这叫“我不希望”。", "char_start": 323, "char_end": 358}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "没有能力充分地认识这一点，没有能力在充分认识的基础上解脱这种烦恼，那就去认识、去解脱，而不是自投罗网之后妄想凭什么智慧和蛮力去把这罗网撕破、打穿。", "char_start": 360, "char_end": 433}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "一个成年人一定要建立权柄意识，了解清楚哪些事务根本就没有自己发表立场的余地。如果你有这种意识，你会发现大量的“在这里我的立场根本没有意义”“我无权表态”“我不能用我的喜好来影响当事人自己的判断”的情况。", "char_start": 434, "char_end": 535}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这样你才能把你有限的智慧和精力投入到相对集中的领域里来。", "char_start": 536, "char_end": 564}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "不但少烦恼，而且出成就。", "char_start": 565, "char_end": 577}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这里要注意——这不叫“事不关己”。", "char_start": 579, "char_end": 596}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "子女是否生育，当然事关重大，当然事关乎己。哪来什么“事不关己”？", "char_start": 597, "char_end": 629}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "但是“事关乎己“并不等于你就有权干预。这就是个经典的例子。", "char_start": 630, "char_end": 659}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你要意识到，每个人都有天赐的、正当的影响别人、影响你的权柄。并不因为会影响到你，你就当然有权去干预和剥夺别人的正当权利。", "char_start": 660, "char_end": 720}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "别人排队排在你前面，有没有影响你？你能把人家踢出队伍吗？别人跟你考同一个学校，是不是影响你的录取率？你能把人家打出考场吗？", "char_start": 721, "char_end": 782}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "我当然关心，但我关心我也没权利这么干。所以当我说“我无权表态”，这是不能拿来作为“我不关心”的“罪证”的。", "char_start": 783, "char_end": 836}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "所以我不会因为我斩钉截铁地说“我无权表态”就暗示自己这意味着“我不关心”。", "char_start": 837, "char_end": 874}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "很多父母在这种时候最容易犯这种错误——ta们会误认为“我不管，我不关心”和“我无权表态”是同一种答案。", "char_start": 875, "char_end": 926}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "不，这两者完全不是同一种答案。", "char_start": 927, "char_end": 942}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "前者是错的。", "char_start": 943, "char_end": 949}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "为了清晰地避免误解——因为人是一种很没出息的动物，无时无刻不在往坏处想——你应该说“我很关心这个问题，但我无权干预 / 无权表态 / 无权用我的喜好来干预你的判断”。", "char_start": 950, "char_end": 1033}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "我很关心，但我无权干预。", "char_start": 1034, "char_end": 1046}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 27}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0389"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如果你的孩子长大后突然跟你说，他以后不结婚，不生孩子，不想像你那么累，你会同意吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024"], "summary": "围绕“自脱罗网”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“人一定要对自己的权柄有概念，这样可以少很多折磨。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "人一定要对自己的权柄有概念，这样可以少很多折磨。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "defa96aa-07e2-586f-a675-05858f3368cd", "source_ordinal": 1388, "reading_ordinal": 2669, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "多余的刺头", "published_at": "2024-08-14T22:23:49+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/d2debbcc5a4811efacf25254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "一般而言，应该是直接谈钱。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "讲清楚怎么做可以得奖金，怎么做会扣钱，然后把评判权捏在自己手里。", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "到了月底当众发一个奖金，再当众扣一个钱。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 67}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不用挨个批评、挨个鼓励，只单独的奖励那个特别突出的，单独惩罚那个特别糟糕的，然后你自己的标准掌握得可靠一点——这不是指“公平”，而是指“受管理者绝大部分能接受”。", "char_start": 68, "char_end": 149}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "绝大部分人能接受就可以，极少数人可能还是会喊不公平。不错，这极少数人的意见未必是错的，的确还是有可能存在绝对意义上的、细微的不公平，但你做到绝大多数人能接受，你就可以表示“不好意思，能力有限，下次再改”了。", "char_start": 150, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "不否定你的道理，但不会反复按你的意见改来改去。记录在案，下次再说。", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 287}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "不要承诺绝对的公平。", "char_start": 288, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "如果按绝对公平是50，我只能承诺45～55。", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你放心，你再得罪我，我也不至于给你42，这绝对有保证。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 349}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "但具体对你个人是45还是55……不好意思，事实上看我心情。", "char_start": 350, "char_end": 379}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "所以，你最好不要让我心情不好。", "char_start": 380, "char_end": 395}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "怎么会让我心情好，怎么会让我心情不好，我一句话也说不清楚。你要真的在乎，你可以多读这几千篇文档。", "char_start": 396, "char_end": 444}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这几千篇我不是全都同意，但是基本上“虽不中亦不远矣”。", "char_start": 445, "char_end": 472}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你要是没精力研究，也可以直接拿职业生涯碰运气，这是你的权利。", "char_start": 473, "char_end": 503}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "总之，我保证不低于45。", "char_start": 504, "char_end": 516}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "低于45，你应该可以找到不少和你同样不满的同事，这很客观。", "char_start": 517, "char_end": 546}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你要想在我手里得到55，你就多去研究我喜欢什么、欣赏什么。", "char_start": 547, "char_end": 576}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "就是这么直白。", "char_start": 577, "char_end": 584}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "少讲道理，少做教育，直接奖励那些在乎你的偏好、积极响应的员工，然后宽容一个不过分的“刺头”，以免中间的员工心寒、紧张。", "char_start": 585, "char_end": 644}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "把除了这个刺头之外的“多余的刺头”干脆利索的开除。", "char_start": 645, "char_end": 670}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "保持这个格局，就差不多了。", "char_start": 671, "char_end": 684}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "顺便，这给了你一点提示——刺头不是绝对不能当，但绝不能当“多余的刺头”。", "char_start": 686, "char_end": 722}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "极易完蛋。", "char_start": 723, "char_end": 728}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 25}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0389"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何管理文化程度不高的基层员工？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“多余的刺头”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“一般而言，应该是直接谈钱。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "一般而言，应该是直接谈钱。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "92d52ba7-4dbf-5985-82d1-4dffd7a0fe55", "source_ordinal": 1387, "reading_ordinal": 2670, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "未保护动物", "published_at": "2024-08-15T16:22:20+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/664306989/answer/3595426571"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "《保护动物名单》应该改为《允许利用动物名单》。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "所有不在名单上的动物一概视为受保护动物。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "否则，冷门珍稀动物、罕见的新发现新物种都将因为奇货可居而加倍的容易毁灭。", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 81}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "超出名单外的动物资源利用，必须经过审核和批准，并且要依法规经营。", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 114}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 4}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0389"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待网友爆料某蚁商为垄断在达州神龙溶洞栖息的具有重要价值的穴胫步甲，而在神龙洞进行了大量投毒？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004"], "summary": "围绕“未保护动物”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“《保护动物名单》应该改为《允许利用动物名单》。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "《保护动物名单》应该改为《允许利用动物名单》。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "545cea71-489e-5292-9080-e05c4e40052e", "source_ordinal": 1386, "reading_ordinal": 2671, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "回潮", "published_at": "2024-08-16T12:17:55+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/664204678/answer/3596264793"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "其实这个问题早就讨论过。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "中国的近现代文化对法律有过强的憧憬和崇拜，因此对司法有着一种过度美好的期待，而不是将司法按照其本来的样子，看作一种“不得已而为之、未必能满足期望”的救济工具。", "char_start": 13, "char_end": 92}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "司法依赖财政收入、人类智慧、客观证据，而这些资源对于实现理想的正义是非常有限的。虽然它以此为使命，但这在原则上就一定是有差距的。", "char_start": 93, "char_end": 157}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "所以成熟的人只会把司法看作一种“死马当成活马医”的最后补救手段，而不是将所有的利益安全完全寄托在它身上。", "char_start": 158, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "一旦走到司法这一步，其结果是非常开放性的，绝不是像你所想象的那样“事实如此清楚，还能怎么判”“不这么判一定是贪赃枉法”。", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 271}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "注意，这不是说一定不会如你的愿，而是说如你愿的概率往往会低于你原本的预期。", "char_start": 272, "char_end": 309}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "甚至是远低于你原本的预期。", "char_start": 310, "char_end": 323}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而且这不是司法有什么如你所想象的那样的“巨大的腐败”“严重的问题”，而是自古以来、中外皆然的普遍现象、恒久事实。", "char_start": 324, "char_end": 380}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "司法本来就只有、也只能达到这么个水平，加强不了，提高不到你要的那种“明察秋毫”“不偏不倚”的水平。", "char_start": 381, "char_end": 430}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "法律女神是蒙着眼的，你没见过吗？", "char_start": 431, "char_end": 447}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "近代之前，中国人其实对古代的司法已经形成了这种普遍认识，但是进入近代之后，我们对西方法学体系、对现代的司法水平有了新的憧憬和寄望。", "char_start": 448, "char_end": 513}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "现代司法体系当然相比古代有了巨大的完善和进步，这是客观事实，但是这个基本局限仍然是有效的。", "char_start": 514, "char_end": 559}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "即使以现代的财富、现代的智慧，要应对现代的正义需求，仍然是远远不足的。", "char_start": 560, "char_end": 595}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这不是“司法人是否真的努了力”的问题，这是一个“光速无法超越”“封闭系统的熵总是趋向增加”的规律性的局限。", "char_start": 596, "char_end": 649}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "我们只是又需要几代人、通过无数这样的现实案例、作为一个集体，重新从新时代造成的过度憧憬中渐渐回归更客观的、更现实的认识状态。", "char_start": 650, "char_end": 712}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "其实我们对每一个新的时代进步都是这个过程——", "char_start": 713, "char_end": 735}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "互联网，最初人们不也是有无限美好的憧憬吗？结果互联网只带来了美好的东西而已吗？它带来的危害甚至足以颠覆国家、导致战争。", "char_start": 736, "char_end": 795}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "票选制度，不是也有人觉得“这下行了”吗？结果时间久了，不也一样洋相百出吗？骗子、呆子与疯子在台上逼着你三选一，哪个是下一任救世主？", "char_start": 796, "char_end": 861}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "再说一遍，这不是在说这些东西没有进步意义、没有好处，毕竟极大富裕繁荣了的社会和这些东西息息相关。", "char_start": 862, "char_end": 910}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这只是在说——它们并不能承担你原本的那个终极期望。", "char_start": 911, "char_end": 936}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "它们确实把人类社会举起到一定的高度，但会因为人类社会自身繁荣导致的问题规模的扩大、难度的加深而趋向力不从心，进入祛魅的阶段。", "char_start": 937, "char_end": 999}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "就像你发现你的初恋不是仙女、不是王子，也要吃饭、也要上厕所一样。", "char_start": 1000, "char_end": 1032}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你要痛苦、甚至要与ta分手，这都是你自己的自由，没人能干涉。", "char_start": 1033, "char_end": 1063}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "但是换了下一个，这个过程还是一样。", "char_start": 1064, "char_end": 1081}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "想要长久，你必须做到将对方当作一个会犯错误、会做蠢事、有丑陋无能的一面的人来相处，而不能“把对方当神仙崇拜，一旦落空就大骂分手”。", "char_start": 1082, "char_end": 1147}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "只是要形成这个更成熟的集体意识，那会是一两代人的历史进程，而且还不全是通过“原本不这么想的人后来都想通了”这样温柔的路径，而是还会通过“坚持幻想的人更多的凋零，及时祛魅的人更少受到客观损失和心理消耗”这样一种残酷的自然选择来达到。", "char_start": 1148, "char_end": 1263}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "衷心希望你们通过前一条通道到达彼岸，而不是在后一种机制里被留在此岸。", "char_start": 1264, "char_end": 1298}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "回到这个法官本身——", "char_start": 1299, "char_end": 1309}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "她可能做出了你不赞同的判决，你的不赞同很可能是很有道理的，但只要她的判决仍在司法的技术性范围之内，她就不能被认为有可以惩罚的过失和罪愆。", "char_start": 1310, "char_end": 1378}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "更不必说，即使有罪，也罪不至死。", "char_start": 1379, "char_end": 1395}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 30}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0389"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：你从原告党老汉和法官王佳佳被杀事件的舆论中看到了什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030"], "summary": "围绕“回潮”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“其实这个问题早就讨论过。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "其实这个问题早就讨论过。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "134d07a9-1798-55e8-827e-4881fa3978eb", "source_ordinal": 1385, "reading_ordinal": 2672, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "许仙社会", "published_at": "2024-08-16T15:31:52+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/663604797/answer/3596468855"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "是这个故事有问题，而不是这个电影有多大问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "《白蛇传》展现了一个中国传统社会理论的迷茫——那就是道德规范和伦理规范孰重。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "白蛇报恩是道德规范，法海除妖是伦理规范，这两者冲突，成了两种善不能妥协，搞出了1+1<0，这个迷茫其实在整个人类文明里长期存在，只要揭露出来，就会像电车难题、洞穴奇案一样，有着近乎永恒的生命力。", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 159}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因为理想而言，善与善应该是和谐的，如果善与善矛盾，乃至于你死我活的斗争，那就意味着善不能成为确保平安和幸福的承诺了。", "char_start": 160, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "善如果连平安——甚至更坏，连无罪、甚至只是免罪而已——都不能确保，那么善还值得作为人生的基本价值来追求吗？", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 272}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这才是《白蛇传》原本的精神价值和核心命题。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 294}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "《白蛇传》作为文学作品，还有另一重传播学的优势——富有猎奇性和情色暗示。", "char_start": 295, "char_end": 331}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "上有价值追问，下有猎奇情色，“雅俗共赏”的配方就全了，就足以世代流传了。", "char_start": 332, "char_end": 368}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "问题是，这玩意被搞成了“爱情故事”。", "char_start": 369, "char_end": 387}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "当爱情故事看，这事就不好讲了。", "char_start": 388, "char_end": 403}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "也许这对古人没什么问题，但对现代人，这故事里有一个巨大的问题——许仙毫无性魅力。", "char_start": 404, "char_end": 444}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这跟他的经济条件、社会地位、相貌体力没有关系，而是人格上的虚弱、残疾。", "char_start": 445, "char_end": 480}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "许仙全部的努力几乎都是某种意义上的哀求，所有的成功都几乎建立在ta人的同情、可怜上。", "char_start": 481, "char_end": 523}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "甚至可以说，他的方法论就是“把x事办成的关键就是让特定的人同情我”。", "char_start": 524, "char_end": 558}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "他在不断的寻求这个人那个人同情自己，如果没有获得这个必要的同情，那就长叹一声，加大悲惨感，进一步的争取同情。", "char_start": 559, "char_end": 613}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "谁造成了问题，就去谁门前哭——大师可怜可怜我吧。", "char_start": 614, "char_end": 638}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "他一切都在诉诸权利（right），而从来不诉诸权力（power）。", "char_start": 639, "char_end": 672}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "要获得更多的权利（right），你要做的是不断的说服和辩论，因为权利是别人承认出来的。", "char_start": 673, "char_end": 716}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "要获得更多的权力（power），你要做的是不断的承担劳动和风险——前者靠努力，后者靠智慧。", "char_start": 717, "char_end": 762}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "Power不需要别人许可，只需要自然规律本身批准就即刻生效。", "char_start": 763, "char_end": 793}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "Right是人类授予的，power是天授，看懂这区别没有？", "char_start": 794, "char_end": 823}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "换言之，right就像从代理商手里买，power则是直接找厂家，中间少一层转手、少一道手续，也少一层变数。", "char_start": 824, "char_end": 877}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "爱——尤其是情爱——要的是超强的坚韧性，要最大限度的刚性和确定性，来对抗长达数十年的风险和不确定。", "char_start": 878, "char_end": 927}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这就意味着爱极为看重power，看重对方直接从自然规律中获得更大的能动性的能力。", "char_start": 928, "char_end": 968}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "所以肌肉发达、思路敏捷会极大的加分，而唯唯诺诺、低声下气、处处祈求许可（always asking for permission）这类强烈pro-right而anti-power的行为会被极大的扣分。", "char_start": 969, "char_end": 1069}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "因为这是一种灵魂级的weakness。", "char_start": 1070, "char_end": 1089}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "大丈夫顶天立地，直接从天地要授权，对一切的人类都是出于同情、关爱而友好温柔相待。", "char_start": 1090, "char_end": 1130}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这种“出于同情、关爱的友好和温柔”，和“拜托你允许我活着”是完全不同的两回事。", "char_start": 1131, "char_end": 1170}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "前者才是正确的社会化，后者却是去人格化。", "char_start": 1171, "char_end": 1191}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "社会化必须是在人格成立的基础上达成的人与人之间的有效合作，它要达成的不是人与人之间的无抗拒的奴役关系，不是以大部分人损失人格为代价的所谓合作。", "char_start": 1192, "char_end": 1263}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "因为社会一定会把许仙社会踩在脚底，导致它解体。所以“许仙社会”不可以作为可行的社会理想去追求。", "char_start": 1264, "char_end": 1311}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "某种意义上，pro power的情爱本能是这一隐患的看门人。", "char_start": 1312, "char_end": 1342}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "所以《白蛇传》作为“爱情电影”被骂，实际上是社会自我纠正的机制在通过人的本能直觉在生效。", "char_start": 1343, "char_end": 1387}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "它在禁止活的“白素贞”们真的去喜欢活的“许仙”。", "char_start": 1388, "char_end": 1412}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "它是对的，不然它自己也要完蛋。", "char_start": 1413, "char_end": 1428}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "做人的正道，是去从自然规则手里直接获得权力，然后凭这个权力，去给别人权利。", "char_start": 1429, "char_end": 1466}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "不是自己无法从自然规律里获得权力，于是全副心思都拿来去找别人哀求权利来找补。", "char_start": 1467, "char_end": 1505}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 37}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0389"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价追光动画新作《白蛇：浮生》（白蛇 3）？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037"], "summary": "围绕“许仙社会”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“是这个故事有问题，而不是这个电影有多大问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "是这个故事有问题，而不是这个电影有多大问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b962ece7-2906-5410-8ce4-0f32db8a1014", "source_ordinal": 1384, "reading_ordinal": 2673, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "幸福币", "published_at": "2024-08-16T21:34:56+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/41199757/answer/3596797263"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "暂时免于恐惧，就是在享受生活了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "可能是刚做了某个坚实的努力以至于对未来充满了信心，", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "可能是刚继承了一笔遗产于是大感安全，", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "可能是子女争气以至于觉得人生目标已经达到，", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "可能是信仰坚定，笃信死后等待着的是天堂，", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 104}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "可能是暂时麻醉或者转移了注意力，", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "总之，何时免于恐惧，何时你就在享受生活，剩下的只是享受程度的区别，而不是享受与否的区别。", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 166}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这也是为什么幸福的源泉是勇气。", "char_start": 167, "char_end": 182}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "人要不择手段的获得和珍惜勇气，哪怕去找人借、去“骗”自己、去偷未来、去抢机会也罢，每一分勇气都要想办法搞到手，抓得牢牢的。", "char_start": 183, "char_end": 244}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "勇气就是幸福的本币，因为恐惧是幸福的唯一敌人。", "char_start": 245, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "获得幸福——哪怕是幸福感——的所有秘诀都是获得勇气的具体方法，就这么简单。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 306}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0389"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎样才算真正的享受生活？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“幸福币”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“暂时免于恐惧，就是在享受生活了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "暂时免于恐惧，就是在享受生活了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e1414182-ac9d-5b73-8989-94c27975ee0e", "source_ordinal": 1383, "reading_ordinal": 2674, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "周末安排", "published_at": "2024-08-17T00:28:29+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/9276e94c5bec11efbd3f52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "对于大城市的居民——例如北上广深港还有各省会城市，周末有时间最好尽可能安排邀请朋友一起看展会、看表演这一类的外出活动。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 59}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "看展览的优先顺序是与你直接相关的专业展会 > 大型综合展（例如消费电子展、工业博览会、广交会、国际进口博览会……）> 艺术展 / 博物展。", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 129}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "看表演则优先看经典的名团名剧，次看先锋新剧。", "char_start": 130, "char_end": 152}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这些能“三五步阅尽山河”的体验是非常重要的，甚至远比看新闻、看网页重要得多。", "char_start": 153, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "首先，因为这些是“实在”的东西，其分量远比互联网上的传闻有效得多。人家千里迢迢把者几吨重的东西运来装好是有巨大的成本的，要传递的当然是极端严肃的信息。这信息的坚实程度仅次于你直接走进对方的车间去看生产线了，而浓缩程度还犹有过之。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 306}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "和你分享这些见闻体验，是建立共同回忆的极好的形式。因为这些信息往往是新鲜的。“在那个会打乒乓球得机械臂旁边吃的那个冰激凌”对你们而言可以记住很久。", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 381}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这种牢固的共同回忆可以作为未来各种来往的宝贵的感情基础。", "char_start": 382, "char_end": 410}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而对哪些事物感兴趣、对何种事物做何种判断和评价，是你观察人的胸襟见识的极好机会，是你择友、择偶的重要依据。", "char_start": 411, "char_end": 464}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而这些又可以做得不动声色，进退自如。", "char_start": 465, "char_end": 483}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "除此之外，那就是尽量安排一些社交活动，例如看电影、打球、钓鱼、参加志愿者活动……等等。", "char_start": 485, "char_end": 528}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这个就没有那么大的前提要求，但也可以获得外界的信息、获得直接的人际接触。", "char_start": 529, "char_end": 565}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这些社交活动如果是愉快的、健康的，可以在很大程度上抑制迷茫和抑郁倾向。这些关系的建立，对你未来面对失业、失恋、病困等等危机的信心有关键的意义。", "char_start": 567, "char_end": 638}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "很多事情靠你一个人都是对付不了的，只要多一个人能哪怕临时的扶一把，对你都是巨大的补益，可以极大的击退你的绝望感。", "char_start": 639, "char_end": 695}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这绝对是一笔需要及早投入的战略投资，贪图打游戏、睡懒觉把这荒废了，到了三十五岁四十岁失个业，发现连一个可以指望的码头、甚至是信源都没有，那时候追悔莫及。", "char_start": 696, "char_end": 772}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "如果你交游广阔而且相处愉快，你这一大帮朋友有某个机会可以提供给你的可能性就总是存在——这种心态开放、社会性充足的人注定是社会支柱，机会总是从ta们产生再流向别人的，哪怕是发生地震、发生战争，这些人也极难全部失意。这是个巨大的资源和安全保障，绝不能轻易错过。", "char_start": 773, "char_end": 901}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "如何能与不同的人都进行愉快的，健康的社交，则是你要获得这份保障所需要付出的必要的研究和尝试。", "char_start": 902, "char_end": 948}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "少tm吹什么“我社恐”之类的蠢话。", "char_start": 949, "char_end": 966}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你年轻时“社恐”，三十五岁失业时可别喊惨。", "char_start": 967, "char_end": 988}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0389"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：下班后及周末的时间都宅在家里，极少出门活动，这样的生活方式有需调整优化的方向吗?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“周末安排”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“对于大城市的居民——例如北上广深港还有各省会城市，周末有时间最好尽可能安排邀请朋友一起看展会、看表演这一类的外出活动。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "对于大城市的居民——例如北上广深港还有各省会城市，周末有时间最好尽可能安排邀请朋友一起看展会、看表演这一类的外出活动。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 59, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6399c2c1-7219-5681-bbc9-c9210cdd661f", "source_ordinal": 1382, "reading_ordinal": 2675, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "止争", "published_at": "2024-08-17T04:02:36+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/7b8ab2865c0a11efbacb5254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "教育理念不同时，那就只有双方互相博弈了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "博弈方式可以是互相说服、可以是猜硬币、可以是请专家……可以是任何双方认可的方法，这其实都没有什么绝对的原则问题。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这其中只有两条要害：", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 88}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "1）要确认对方的提议是基于对子女的爱。", "char_start": 89, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "对错不重要，只要你相信对方的提议是出于对子女的爱，而是是出于别的什么此外的目的。", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 149}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你们的博弈能保证有好结果的前提，必须是在两个或多个出于爱的选择之间选，而绝不能是在出于爱和并非出于爱的选择之间选。", "char_start": 150, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "只要所有的选项都是出于爱，那么它们的水平高低、具体路径的差别，都是细节问题、非原则问题。无论走哪条路，即使带来痛苦（实际上痛苦总是不可避免的），爱本身都可以极大的补救其不足，救赎其过失。", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 301}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "有爱罪减一等。没有罪在其中，剩下的都是天命。", "char_start": 302, "char_end": 324}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "天命所钟，其无咎矣。", "char_start": 325, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "所以，不要和对方争论合理性、合算性，而要争论这是否有不合乎爱的原则的地方，是否可以问心无愧的对将来的子女自陈为爱，是否面对良心的审判而可以坦然。", "char_start": 336, "char_end": 408}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "2）要相信只要是程序合规的从爱的选项中诞生的结果，哪怕不如自己本人的意，也一定会在最终对子女有益。", "char_start": 410, "char_end": 459}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "因为这个时候你可以认为双方都已经尽力，现在是上天在通过偶然性表示意见。", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 495}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "爱总是受到世界祝福的。如果你看了这几千个答案，你应该意识到了——出于爱的决断是会受到一切自然规律所确保的社会机制的自然保护的。", "char_start": 496, "char_end": 559}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "它还会有折磨，但已经是你可以指望的最小折磨。", "char_start": 560, "char_end": 582}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "它仍然会有迂回和蹉跎，但将来答案揭晓时所有人都会明白，这已经是最小的迂回和蹉跎。", "char_start": 583, "char_end": 623}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你相信，你就会安静，就会有耐心，就能在这个充满迷茫和焦躁的过程中保持淡定并提供宁静。", "char_start": 624, "char_end": 666}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "其实真正导致结果趋向好结果、趋向幸福的，不是什么决策的智慧，或者先见之明，而是这个过程中这份钢铁般的耐心和宁静。", "char_start": 667, "char_end": 723}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "灾难其实并不是来自选择的错误，而是对选择的无穷尽的怀疑导致的挣扎与善变。", "char_start": 724, "char_end": 760}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这种程度的宁静和坚定，能把一切坏主意都孵化出好结果。", "char_start": 761, "char_end": 787}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "而那种程度的焦躁和多变，则会把一切好方案引向坏下场。", "char_start": 788, "char_end": 814}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "正确与否的关键不在乎方案，而在乎信。", "char_start": 815, "char_end": 833}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "而信的根源不在于智慧，而在于爱。", "char_start": 834, "char_end": 850}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "两个方案都是天为这个小孩所选的人出于爱为ta制定的，然后天意又通过这两个人一致同意的机制做出了选择。", "char_start": 851, "char_end": 901}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "无论这个结果是什么，这个结果都会有超过任何一方的俗世智慧的祝福——这一点没有什么科学方法可以证明，你只能纯粹的凭信心去相信。", "char_start": 902, "char_end": 964}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你能信，你的信所带来的平静就能把这个起点推向尽可能好的终点。", "char_start": 965, "char_end": 995}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你信不了，哪怕选的是你的方案，你无法挥除的自我怀疑最后还是会将你自己的初衷反复的扭曲，直到完全迷茫——你真的确信你自己就是完全正确的吗？你在开什么玩笑？", "char_start": 996, "char_end": 1072}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "其实，不只是子女的教育问题，而是所有的爱人之间的分歧在根本上都是同一个解决方案。", "char_start": 1073, "char_end": 1113}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "而这个解决方案要能行得通，得要你懂得爱、对方懂得爱，并且你们彼此敢于相信对方的爱。", "char_start": 1114, "char_end": 1155}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "能相信，你就能凭这个机制，在自己的理智不能完全领会和认同的前提下，真正平静的接受分歧的结果，并将无论什么结果引向尽可能良性的方向。", "char_start": 1156, "char_end": 1221}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "不能信，一切的分歧都是无休止的。你要全然顺你的意，否则你难以抑制你的恐惧，而ta又何尝不要全然顺ta的意，否则ta又何尝没有难以抑制的恐惧？", "char_start": 1222, "char_end": 1292}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这种“只有全如我意我才能安枕”的心态必定指向要么分离，要么暴力征服这两个结果。", "char_start": 1293, "char_end": 1332}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "而这两个结果都是坏的——甚至后者比前者还坏。", "char_start": 1333, "char_end": 1355}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "对爱的确信和对爱的信心，是人战胜自身的“理智”，保持开放心态、保持宽容的最终依靠。", "char_start": 1356, "char_end": 1397}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "这是唯一的答案，不必再寻找了。", "char_start": 1398, "char_end": 1413}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 35}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0389"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：夫妻间教育理念不同怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034"], "summary": "围绕“止争”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“教育理念不同时，那就只有双方互相博弈了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "教育理念不同时，那就只有双方互相博弈了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
